1
00:00:01,556 --> 00:00:04,698
Attack of the Final Boss!

2
00:00:08,435 --> 00:00:12,384
You and I~ Let us go~!

3
00:00:12,384 --> 00:00:15,387
Down to the beach~ Together-

4
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,594
What is that?

5
00:00:25,646 --> 00:00:26,446
Huh?

6
00:00:31,974 --> 00:00:33,393
Aah!

7
00:00:47,981 --> 00:00:50,817
Jun seems to be in high spirits today.

8
00:00:50,817 --> 00:00:54,307
He got a new bike from his parents for his birthday.

9
00:00:56,569 --> 00:00:58,920
And that's not all I got!

10
00:01:00,570 --> 00:01:04,301
Ah, and it looks like Anna gave him that multi-scarf.

11
00:01:04,301 --> 00:01:05,522
I can tell...

12
00:01:06,212 --> 00:01:09,310
Say, what's a birthday?

13
00:01:09,310 --> 00:01:11,585
It's the day he popped out from his mother's belly.

14
00:01:11,585 --> 00:01:13,704
He popped out from a belly?!?!

15
00:01:13,704 --> 00:01:15,596
Not like that...

16
00:01:15,596 --> 00:01:18,799
It's a day to celebrate being born into this world.

17
00:01:18,799 --> 00:01:19,480
Ahh...

18
00:01:21,980 --> 00:01:23,807
So... I guess it's a day to celebrate Jun?

19
00:01:23,807 --> 00:01:25,777
Shouldn't we get something for him too?

20
00:01:25,777 --> 00:01:27,319
You mean... a gift?

21
00:01:27,319 --> 00:01:28,634
But I'm broke.

22
00:01:28,634 --> 00:01:30,835
Hey, what if we save money on fuel...

23
00:01:30,835 --> 00:01:32,462
But fuel prices have gone up!

24
00:01:32,692 --> 00:01:34,597
Hey guys, I have something to discuss with you.

25
00:01:34,646 --> 00:01:35,692
Huh?

26
00:01:41,241 --> 00:01:43,728
This was inside the escape pod we stopped yesterday.

27
00:01:43,728 --> 00:01:45,801
Is it a trailer?

28
00:01:45,801 --> 00:01:48,664
Where's the truck that transports it?

29
00:01:48,664 --> 00:01:51,146
It's likely to be in the part that separated and fell into the sea.

30
00:01:51,146 --> 00:01:55,478
So the owner of this trailer was inside the escape pod?

31
00:01:56,557 --> 00:01:57,444
Jun.

32
00:01:57,444 --> 00:02:00,459
Please look up the data on this trailer using the Metal Breath.

33
00:02:01,521 --> 00:02:02,986
...like this?

34
00:02:08,139 --> 00:02:09,858
Data access complete.

35
00:02:12,193 --> 00:02:14,203
Code name: Heavy Iron.

36
00:02:14,203 --> 00:02:15,752
This belongs to Heavy Iron?!

37
00:02:15,752 --> 00:02:19,788
So he's landed here too, then.

38
00:02:19,788 --> 00:02:20,925
What's wrong? Who is he?

39
00:02:20,925 --> 00:02:23,762
He's one scary Metal Cardbot.

40
00:02:23,762 --> 00:02:29,217
The most powerful and evil outlaw that will use brute force to crush anyone he doesn't like!

41
00:02:29,217 --> 00:02:33,480
He's sure to come here looking for the trailer, since it's a part of his body.

42
00:02:33,480 --> 00:02:35,222
We may already be too late.

43
00:02:36,687 --> 00:02:37,566
Anna!

44
00:02:37,566 --> 00:02:40,110
Too late? What do you mean by that?

45
00:02:41,245 --> 00:02:42,694
Look at this.

46
00:02:44,901 --> 00:02:49,780
Let me see... an oil tanker explodes in the waters near Mowtown.

47
00:02:49,780 --> 00:02:53,259
One survivor said they saw a huge shadowy form swimming in the ocean...

48
00:02:53,259 --> 00:02:55,310
Did it collide with a whale?

49
00:02:55,310 --> 00:02:56,709
No, this is...

50
00:02:56,709 --> 00:02:58,533
Could it be...? Heavy Iron?

51
00:02:58,533 --> 00:02:59,651
For real?!

52
00:03:01,461 --> 00:03:04,911
This is the location where the escape pod landed.

53
00:03:04,911 --> 00:03:06,910
The oil tanker sunk over here.

54
00:03:06,910 --> 00:03:10,438
You mean that... it's headed towards Mowtown?

55
00:03:10,438 --> 00:03:12,668
Let's move the trailer somewhere outside town!

56
00:03:12,668 --> 00:03:14,479
We don't want anyone to get hurt!

57
00:03:14,479 --> 00:03:15,610
Right.

58
00:03:15,959 --> 00:03:18,949
So who's going to tow it?

59
00:03:24,163 --> 00:03:32,610
Hrgh! I knew this was going to happen! UGH!

60
00:03:32,610 --> 00:03:36,896
Stop complaining. I made sure the trailer was properly hitched.

61
00:03:36,896 --> 00:03:39,745
This trailer is super heavy!

62
00:03:43,871 --> 00:03:45,396
Jun! Look!

63
00:03:54,841 --> 00:03:56,307
Listen up.

64
00:03:56,307 --> 00:03:58,995
I want to know where you're planning on taking my other half. 

65
00:03:58,995 --> 00:04:00,200
Heavy Iron!

66
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,610
How did he catch up to us so fast?

67
00:04:01,610 --> 00:04:02,574
Huh?

68
00:04:03,978 --> 00:04:04,639
Ha!

69
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:07,144
There's an empty construction site up ahead!

70
00:04:07,144 --> 00:04:08,526
Let's head over there!

71
00:04:08,526 --> 00:04:11,824
Mega Ambler, Phoenix Fire! Try to keep Heavy Iron busy!

72
00:04:11,824 --> 00:04:12,591
Got it!

73
00:04:15,955 --> 00:04:18,233
Come on then, you outlaw.
74
00:04:18,233 --> 00:04:20,417
Yeah! You'll have to get through us!

75
00:04:20,417 --> 00:04:22,579
Overconfident fools!

76
00:04:30,526 --> 00:04:33,704
This is perfect! We won't attract any attention out here.

77
00:04:33,704 --> 00:04:36,730
What do we do now? Heavy Iron will be here soon.

78
00:04:36,730 --> 00:04:39,182
Let's hide the trailer in that tunnel first!

79
00:04:40,490 --> 00:04:43,490
You'll have to back it in!

80
00:04:43,490 --> 00:04:44,682
Huh? Why should I do that?

81
00:04:44,682 --> 00:04:47,552
If you go in head first, you won't be able to get out.

82
00:04:47,552 --> 00:04:50,340
I'll direct you. Now, hurry up!

83
00:04:50,340 --> 00:04:52,151
Ugh, what a pain.

84
00:04:57,555 --> 00:04:59,326
Heh. Pathetic.

85
00:05:00,454 --> 00:05:01,249
Stop!

86
00:05:03,228 --> 00:05:04,600
He's coming!

87
00:05:07,512 --> 00:05:08,963
Metal Breath, pickup!

88
00:05:10,757 --> 00:05:12,442
Shadow X, setup!

89
00:05:20,701 --> 00:05:23,769
Shadow X, Spinning Cutter!

90
00:05:23,769 --> 00:05:24,713
Spinning Cutter!

91
00:05:27,795 --> 00:05:29,358
Why's he such a hardhead?!

92
00:05:29,358 --> 00:05:32,865
If that's the case, Heli-Tornado!

93
00:05:33,300 --> 00:05:35,399
Got it!

94
00:05:35,399 --> 00:05:36,918
Heli-Tornado!

95
00:05:39,242 --> 00:05:41,132
Haha! How ya like that?!

96
00:05:48,845 --> 00:05:50,518
I don't believe it!

97
00:05:50,518 --> 00:05:51,336
Jun!

98
00:05:52,699 --> 00:05:54,379
Blue Cop, setup!

99
00:06:04,629 --> 00:06:07,310
Blue Cop, Thunderbolt Smash!

100
00:06:12,848 --> 00:06:14,230
Thunderbolt...

101
00:06:14,230 --> 00:06:15,189
Smash!!

102
00:06:24,567 --> 00:06:26,970
Blue Cop! Are you okay?!

103
00:06:29,959 --> 00:06:31,660
Where is my other half?

104
00:06:32,271 --> 00:06:33,507
Right here!

105
00:06:35,754 --> 00:06:38,278
If you want it, then come and get it!

106
00:06:38,579 --> 00:06:39,300
Ha.

107
00:06:40,257 --> 00:06:41,677
Anna, let's take cover!

108
00:06:49,223 --> 00:06:49,667
Now!

109
00:06:50,711 --> 00:06:51,999
-Jun!
-Blue Cop!

110
00:06:51,999 --> 00:06:54,947
Cave in the tunnel's entrance with a Burst Shot!

111
00:06:54,947 --> 00:06:56,970
Got it!

112
00:07:09,165 --> 00:07:11,173
Jun, it worked!

113
00:07:11,173 --> 00:07:13,495
What happened? What'd we miss?

114
00:07:13,495 --> 00:07:16,134
We did it! It's game over for the trailer-truck!

115
00:07:19,836 --> 00:07:21,879
W-what was that?

116
00:07:21,879 --> 00:07:22,793
It couldn't be..?

117
00:07:39,336 --> 00:07:41,805
All of you are nothing but an annoyance.

118
00:07:41,805 --> 00:07:43,593
A bunch of little pests.

119
00:07:44,316 --> 00:07:48,264
All you had to do was hand over my trailer.

120
00:07:49,192 --> 00:07:51,643
Now you're going to pay.

121
00:07:52,268 --> 00:07:54,819
That's... Heavy Iron's true form!

122
00:07:54,819 --> 00:07:57,000
He's much larger than I expected.

123
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:00,107
And he looks... really angry!

124
00:08:00,107 --> 00:08:02,682
The bigger they are, the harder they fall!

125
00:08:05,403 --> 00:08:07,160
Let's try a rapid fire assault!

126
00:08:07,810 --> 00:08:09,752
Mega Ambler, setup!

127
00:08:13,583 --> 00:08:16,848
Mega Ambler, use Forceps Crush to stop him from moving!

128
00:08:16,848 --> 00:08:17,519
Hngh!

129
00:08:29,252 --> 00:08:30,562
Forceps Crush!

130
00:08:34,792 --> 00:08:36,711
Phoenix Fire, setup!

131
00:08:40,774 --> 00:08:43,200
Your turn, Phoenix Fire!

132
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:44,418
Burning Hammer!

133
00:08:46,879 --> 00:08:50,639
Yaah! Burning Hammer!

134
00:08:57,845 --> 00:08:59,721
How do you like the heat?!

135
00:09:00,917 --> 00:09:06,822
Hahaha. You couldn't even put a scratch in my iron with that.

136
00:09:07,157 --> 00:09:08,988
I'll show you what true power is!

137
00:09:14,788 --> 00:09:16,519
What is that?

138
00:09:20,523 --> 00:09:21,947
Is he trying to end us all?!

139
00:09:21,947 --> 00:09:23,202
We have to stop him! Hurry up!

140
00:09:23,403 --> 00:09:26,956
Oh! Uh, uhh... Hang on!

141
00:09:27,928 --> 00:09:31,177
Iron Cannon!!

142
00:09:44,562 --> 00:09:47,289
Anna! Are you okay?!

143
00:09:49,283 --> 00:09:51,178
Theo. Are you alright?

144
00:09:51,178 --> 00:09:53,792
I think so... are we still alive...?

145
00:09:54,423 --> 00:09:57,301
Now do you brats understand?

146
00:09:57,301 --> 00:10:00,721
I am the most powerful Metal Cardbot.

147
00:10:00,721 --> 00:10:02,639
I am Heavy Iron!

148
00:10:05,234 --> 00:10:08,469
Now... kneel before me.

149
00:10:08,469 --> 00:10:13,196
Swear loyalty to me, and I will let you live.

150
00:10:13,196 --> 00:10:16,807
You should know well by now that resistance is futile.

151
00:10:27,514 --> 00:10:29,183
W-What the...?

152
00:10:29,855 --> 00:10:31,711
Now's our chance, Blue Cop!

153
00:10:31,711 --> 00:10:34,460
Megabolt Punch!

154
00:10:35,153 --> 00:10:42,509
Megabolt...

155
00:10:42,509 --> 00:10:44,750
Punch!!

156
00:11:00,380 --> 00:11:03,740
I'll let you go today, since I recovered my other half.

157
00:11:03,740 --> 00:11:04,731
However!...

158
00:11:04,731 --> 00:11:07,129
You are going to pay for this!

159
00:11:10,363 --> 00:11:12,514
Thanks, you saved us all.

160
00:11:12,662 --> 00:11:13,379
Hm?

161
00:11:15,230 --> 00:11:16,552
They disappeared.

162
00:11:18,831 --> 00:11:21,841
But... who could that have been?

